# local data snapshots
data/
*.parquet

# Generated reports. `viz` inlines real project names, usage and credit
# balances into the page, so a built report is data, not source.
*.html
# The extension's page is source and contains no data at all: it is empty
# markup that fills itself from the API at view time.
!web/src/report.html

# The plotly bundle the extension loads, written by `pixi run web-vendor` out
# of the same `plotly.offline.get_plotlyjs()` the command-line report inlines.
# Five megabytes of somebody else's code, reproducible in one command, and
# pinned to whatever the Python environment resolves -- so the two reports
# cannot drift onto different plotly versions.
web/vendor/
